// Diagnostics that point at the real problem: a list compared with `[]`
// is a list comparison, a decision can't be a map value, and a number in
// a notation Sigil doesn't have isn't an unknown duration unit.
policy p: DeployApproval@1

when actor.regions != [] {
  deny(a)
}

---

policy q: DeployApproval@1

assert("expected", {"payments": approve}["payments"] in outcome)

---

policy r: DeployApproval@1

when release.soak < 0x10 or 1e3 > 1_000 {
  deny(a)
}
